# Generated evidence. regressions/ is deliberately NOT ignored — the promoted
# failure library is meant to be committed and reviewed like source.
# Note the ** prefix: a pattern with an interior slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so plain `.backtests/runs/` would miss examples/*/.backtests.
**/.backtests/runs/
**/.backtests/reports/
*.tsbuildinfo
examples/**/node_modules/
